# Routine "Monthly proof refresh": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Run on the first Monday of each month at the hour the user picked, in the timezone saved in memory. Compute the cron from that timezone. Read the proof bank and check three things. Age: every quote and number older than 12 months, and say where it is currently published so they know what is out in …
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/customer-stories && pi -p "/monthly-proof-refresh"
